  "cooked": "<p>I did not see any significant drop or change in Tor peer connectivity on these dates across.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/04ad2fe27f01d863fadfbfda266681d2b8ac76f1.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/04ad2fe27f01d863fadfbfda266681d2b8ac76f1\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/04ad2fe27f01d863fadfbfda266681d2b8ac76f1_2_690x201.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"FmXBIqVAmzLRRveZs1ARFIbpkJ\" width=\"690\" height=\"201\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/04ad2fe27f01d863fadfbfda266681d2b8ac76f1_2_690x201.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/04ad2fe27f01d863fadfbfda266681d2b8ac76f1_2_1035x301.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/04ad2fe27f01d863fadfbfda266681d2b8ac76f1_2_1380x402.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1F2122\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1846\u00d7540 160 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Neither did I see any significant connection drop or change in connectivity from IPv4 connections from Tor exit nodes.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/d01b37aa195ab22518ebcc09165d495fbfb6cdcd.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/d01b37aa195ab22518ebcc09165d495fbfb6cdcd\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/d01b37aa195ab22518ebcc09165d495fbfb6cdcd_2_690x307.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"tGZCRZhlmP7dDAlJZd0PiXQ1I5f\" width=\"690\" height=\"307\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/d01b37aa195ab22518ebcc09165d495